<newsitem itemid="17566" id="root" date="1996-08-27" xml:lang="en">
<title>GERMANY: Kaufring first half sales rise.</title>
<headline>Kaufring first half sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group business volume		    1,345   vs 1,362</p>
<p>    Group sales				  619     vs 583</p>
<p>    Group workforce			    3,225   vs 2,386</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German retailer is Kaufring AG. The rise in the workforce number was due to the first-time consolidation of Weka-Kaufring-Kaufhaus GmbH and Sono Centra. -- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
